<title>USA: Conrail says to hold board meeting Monday.</title>
<headline>Conrail says to hold board meeting Monday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conrail Inc said it will hold a board meeting Monday to consider options relating to its proposed merger with CSX Corp.</p>
<p>The announcement came amid widespread reports that a four-month takeover battle for control of the railroad may soon be settled with an agreement that would split up Conrail assets between rival bidders CSX and Norfolk Southern Corp.</p>
<p>A Conrail spokesman declined to elaborate on the time of the meeting or the options that will be considered.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
